{
  "about": "A block's kind (docs/dev/user_db.md, the unified_blocks kind column): the generated kind column (gamma/db.py BLOCK_HOT_COLUMNS), gamma/blocks_store.py block_kind and frontend/src/editor/blockProps.js blockKind. props holds a block's properties and the kind they make, the first rule winning in the column's order: ink (an ink_url key, whatever its value), text_box, picture, sheet, recording (an object there), link (a link_url or link_page_id neither missing, null nor ''), highlight (a pdf_position object), note. tree holds the rows whose place decides first: a page under root or the trash, a folder or a label in their trees. backend/tests/test_block_columns.py writes every props row through SQL and checks the column, block_kind and the API agree; frontend/tests/blockProps.test.mjs checks blockKind.",
